# Portability patches (format and list: docs/UPSTREAM_CHANGES.md).
patch: joltik-eq-xls-tag-offset
why: joltik_aead_decrypt computed XLSin+c_len-8-8*(i-1) with XLSin a 16-byte array: left to right that forms the pointer XLSin+c_len,
why: which UBSan reports as 'index N out of bounds for uint8_t[16]' (joltik.c, CI run 45581879065), before subtracting back.
why: The patch parenthesises the offset, XLSin+(c_len-8-8*(i-1)); the offset is the partial block length s (1..7), the destination byte is identical and output is unchanged.
file: upstream/ref/joltik.c
count: 1
find:       memcpy(XLSin+c_len-8-8*(i-1), ciphertext+c_len-8, 8); /* append tag */
replace:       memcpy(XLSin+(c_len-8-8*(i-1)), ciphertext+c_len-8, 8); /* append tag */
